ncmpcpp is the music player.

Navigation:
	h/j/k/l - Left/down/up/right
	d/u - Page down/up
	g/G - Go to top/bottom

Playback:
	p - Pause/unpause

Library:
	a - Add song(s) to playlist
	c - Clear playlist
	m - Media library
	f - Browse by directory structure
	s - Search
	t - Tag editor

Views:
	v - Visualizer
	P - Playlist
